## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Rationale |
|---|---|
| Returns latest args | Ensures the final call uses the **most recent** inputs, not the first. |
| `.cancel()` | Critical for memory leaks — always cancel on unmount/teardown. |
| `lead`/`trailing` options | Mirrors common utility libraries (Lodash) and covers both UX patterns: immediate feedback vs. consolidated final action. |
| Preserves `this` context | Works correctly as a method (`obj.method = debounce(obj.method, 100)`) or with `call`/`apply`. |

